<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH CUP FOURTH ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH CUP FOURTH ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the fourth round of the</p>
<p>Scottish Cup, made on Saturday evening: Brechin or Alloa v</p>
<p>Airdrieonians or Raith</p>
<p>Hearts v Dundee United</p>
<p>Falkirk or Berwick v Dunfermline</p>
<p>Arbroath or Greenock Morton v Dundee</p>
<p>Motherwell v Hamilton</p>
<p>Hibernian or Aberdeen v Clydebank or Celtic</p>
<p>Clyde v Kilmarnock</p>
<p>Rangers v East Fife</p>
<p>Matches to be played Saturday, Feb 15</p>
